Upstream sources
----------------
The corpus is derived from publicly accessible play-by-play and box-score
feeds. Those feeds carry their own terms, which are not superseded by the
licences above. SOURCES.md documents each source, what was taken from it, and
the basis on which it was used.

The CC BY 4.0 licence applies to this reconstruction — the stint segmentation,
the identity reconciliation, and the derived metric boards — not to the
